  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "漢字書寫與書法概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO CHINESE CHARACTER WRITING AND CALLIGRAPHY",
    "describe_ch": "使學生具備書法相關知識及欣賞能力，並掌握書法基本書寫要領，進而培養學生書法研習興趣，提升文字書寫能力，同時透過教學引導，一探書法黑白奧區，涵泳線條與結構之三維空間世界，領受中國特有之筆墨魅力與中國文化之博大精深。",
    "describe_eh": "To enable students to have the knowledge and appreciation of calligraphy, and to master the basic essentials of calligraphy, so as to cultivate their interest in calligraphy study and improve their writing skills. \r\nAt the same time, through teaching and guidance, explore the black and white mysteries of calligraphy, understand the three-dimensional world of lines and structures, and receive the unique charm of Chinese brushwork and the profoundness of Chinese culture.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
